gricultural centre with deep Zulu heritage. The annual Newcastle Show and surrounding battlefields make it a town of contrasts.\",\"population_estimate\":40000,\"archetype\":\"industrial_town\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-aica-newcastle\",\"title\":\"AI Café — Digital Access Point / CV Service Agent\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-newcastle\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"aicafe\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-ubun-newcastle-2\",\"title\":\"Ubuntu Academy — Skills & Job Readiness Workshop\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-newcastle\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"ubuntu_academy\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-orbi-newcastle-3\",\"title\":\"Orbit Music — Youth AI Music Creation Workshop\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-newcastle\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"orbit_music\"}}],\"businesses\":[{\"slug\":\"newcastle\",\"name\":\"Newcastle Show Grounds\",\"category\":\"tourism\",\"is_verified\":false,\"id\":\"seed-newcastle-biz\",\"town_id\":null}],\"cv_count\":1},{\"slug\":\"kokstad\",\"name\":\"Kokstad\",\"region\":\"Harry Gwala · Griqualand east\",\"district\":\"Harry Gwala\",\"status\":\"building\",\"render_pct\":15,\"opportunity_potential\":45,\"heritage\":false,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/kokstad\",\"illustrative\":true,\"coordinator_name\":\"Lerato Maseko\",\"youth_mapped\":0,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":0,\"lat\":-30.55,\"lng\":30.4167,\"description\":\"IsiGqubu town in southern KZN, gateway to the Drakensberg and home to the annual Kokstad Show.\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-ecoc-kokstad\",\"title\":\"EcoChar — 5-Day Charcoal Production Training\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-kokstad\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"ecochar\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-bunt-kokstad-2\",\"title\":\"BuntuBar — Mobile Bar Event Workshop\",\"type\":\"training\",\"