imber town nestled in the Umzimkulu valley, gateway to the Wild Coast.\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-insi-harding\",\"title\":\"Inside.Town — Community Podcast Producer\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-harding\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"inside_town\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-fram-harding-2\",\"title\":\"FrameSouth — Town Photographer / Visual Proof Creator\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-harding\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"framesouth\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-fixe-harding-3\",\"title\":\"FixEasy24 — Verified Service Provider Registration\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-harding\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"fixeasy24\"}}],\"cv_count\":1},{\"slug\":\"estcourt\",\"name\":\"Estcourt\",\"region\":\"uMsunduzi · midlands\",\"district\":\"uMtshezi\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":32,\"heritage\":false,\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/estcourt\",\"illustrative\":true,\"lat\":-29.0167,\"lng\":29.8833,\"description\":\"A small midlands town between Durban and the Drakensberg, Estcourt is a gateway to both the mountains and the battlefields of Isandlwana and Rorke's Drift.\",\"population_estimate\":18000,\"archetype\":\"midlands\"},{\"slug\":\"ulundi\",\"name\":\"Ulundi\",\"region\":\"Zululand · royal capital\",\"district\":\"Zululand\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"heritage\":true,\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/ulundi\",\"illustrative\":true,\"lat\":-28.3333,\"lng\":31.4167,\"description\":\"Former capital of KwaZulu, seat of the Zulu monarchy, and site of the final battle of the Anglo-Zulu War.\"},{\"slug\":\"umlazi\",\"name\":\"Umlazi\",\"region\":\"township\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-29.9667,\"lng\":30.8833,\"description\":\"Durban's largest towns