-iMfolozi Park, the world's oldest game reserve where white rhinos were saved from extinction. This is Big Five country.\",\"population_estimate\":5000,\"archetype\":\"wildlife\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/hluhluwe\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"st-lucia\",\"name\":\"St Lucia\",\"region\":\"ecotourism\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-27.4,\"lng\":32.4333,\"description\":\"The Estuary of the iSimangaliso Wetland Park — a UNESCO World Heritage Site where hippos wander the streets and crocodiles sun on the riverbank.\",\"population_estimate\":3000,\"archetype\":\"ecotourism\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/st-lucia\",\"illustrative\":true}],\"hero_image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573790387438-4da905039392?w=1200&q=80\",\"description\":\"Where the Indian Ocean meets Zulu heritage. 12 towns from Durban's golden beaches to the Drakensberg mountains, blending subtropical warmth with deep cultural roots.\"},\"lens\":\"investor\"}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n7:null\n9:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"KwaZulu-Natal — Ubuntu Town Province | Ubuntu Town\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Where the Indian Ocean meets Zulu heritage. 12 towns from Durban's golden beaches to the Drakensberg mountains, blending subtropical warmth with deep cultural r\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://kekelebaka.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Keke Lebaka\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"Ubuntu Town,South Africa,town coordinator,opportunity infrastructure,CV engine,workpacks,proof-based work,agentic economy,Ubuntu Intelligence,Kopano,ambassador network,community coordination,small towns,townships,job matching\"}],[\"$\"